    {
      "id": "intro_2",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "The great racing driver, Sir Malcolm Campbell, was the first man to drive at over 300 miles per hour.",
      "translation": "伟大的赛车手马尔科姆·坎贝尔爵士是第一个以每小时超过300英里的速度驾车的人。",
      "startTime": 15.43,
      "endTime": 26.13,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
