          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "intro_3",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "He set up a new world record in September 1935 at Bonneville Salt Flats, Utah.",
      "translation": "他于1935年9月在犹他州邦纳维尔盐滩创造了一项新的世界纪录。",
      "startTime": 26.14,
      "endTime": 36.31,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "At",
            "pos": "prep.",
            "meaning": "在...（小地点/时刻）"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "intro_4",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "Bluebird, the car he was driving, had been specially built for him.",
      "translation": "他驾驶的'蓝鸟'汽车是专门为他制造的。",
      "startTime": 36.32,
      "endTime": 42.91,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Car",
            "pos": "n.",
            "meaning": "轿车"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "It was over 30 feet in length and had a 2, 500-horsepower engine.",
      "translation": "它长30多英尺，配有一台2500马力的发动机。",
      "startTime": 42.92,
      "endTime": 50.41,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "It",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "它"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "Although Campbell reached a speed of over 304 miles per hour,",
      "translation": "虽然坎贝尔达到了每小时超过304英里的速度，",
      "startTime": 50.42,
      "endTime": 56.19,
      "analysis": {
        "words": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "he had great difficulty in controlling the car because a tyre burst during the first run.",
      "translation": "但他很难控制汽车，因为在第一次行驶中一个轮胎爆了。",
      "startTime": 56.2,
      "endTime": 64.38,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Car",
            "pos": "n.",
            "meaning": "轿车"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "After his attempt, Campbell was disappointed to learn that his average speed had been 299 miles per hour.",
      "translation": "尝试结束后，坎贝尔失望地得知他的平均速度是每小时299英里。",
      "startTime": 64.39,
      "endTime": 75.52,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "That",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "那个"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s5",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "However, a few days later, he was told that a mistake had been made.",
      "translation": "然而，几天后有人告诉他计算出了差错。",
      "startTime": 75.53,
      "endTime": 82.1,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "That",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "那个"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s6",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "His average speed had been 301 miles per hour.",
      "translation": "他的平均速度实际上是每小时301英里。",
      "startTime": 82.11,
      "endTime": 87.53,
      "analysis": {
        "words": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s7",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "Since that time, racing drivers have reached speeds over 600 miles an hour.",
      "translation": "从那时候起，赛车手已经达到了每小时超过600英里的速度。",
      "startTime": 87.54,
      "endTime": 95.57,
      "analysis": {
