            "word": "That",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "那个"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s8",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "Following in his father's footsteps many years later, Sir Malcolm's son, Donald, also set up a world record.",
      "translation": "许多年后，马尔科姆爵士的儿子唐纳德踏着父亲的足迹，也创造了一项世界纪录。",
      "startTime": 95.58,
      "endTime": 105.9,
      "analysis": {
